---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Senses"
  description="How Senses collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <div class="pt-[var(--nav-height)] pb-24">
    <div class="max-w-[680px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16">

      <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase mb-4">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-senses-text text-3xl font-light mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm mb-12">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <div class="prose-senses space-y-10">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">1. Who we are</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Senses is a media discovery platform operated by Dhurta.Org. This policy explains how
            we collect and process information when you use senses.dhurta.org.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">2. What data we store</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Senses is a local-first platform. The vast majority of your data — liked items, saved
            media, collections, download history, comments, and interest signals — is stored only in
            your browser's <code class="text-senses-accent text-xs">localStorage</code>.
            It never leaves your device unless you explicitly export it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We do not operate user accounts, databases of personal data, or authentication servers
            in Version 1 of this platform.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">3. Analytics and third-party services</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Senses may integrate privacy-respecting, cookieless analytics (such as Plausible or
            Fathom) in a future version. No analytics are active in V1.
          </p>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Media thumbnails and previews may be served from third-party CDNs. These providers may
            log standard web access data (IP address, user-agent, referer) per their own policies.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">4. Cookies</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We do not use tracking or advertising cookies. The service worker and PWA manifest do
            not set cookies. Your browser may cache static assets as part of normal web operation.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">5. Your rights</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Because your data is stored locally in your browser, you have full control over it at
            all times:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            {['Clear your browser\'s localStorage to delete all Senses data instantly.',
              'Use your browser\'s developer tools to inspect exactly what is stored.',
              'Clearing the site data or uninstalling the PWA removes all cached assets and local data.'].map(item => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-senses-text-3 text-sm">
                <span class="mt-1.5 w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-senses-accent flex-shrink-0" />
                {item}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">6. Children</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Senses is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from
            children under 13. If you believe a child has submitted information, contact us below.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">7. Changes to this policy</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We may update this policy as the platform evolves. Material changes will be noted with
            an updated "Last updated" date at the top of this page.
          </p>
        </section>

        <div class="border-t border-senses-border" />

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-senses-text text-base font-medium mb-3">8. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-senses-text-3 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Questions about this policy? Email
            <a href="mailto:privacy@senses.dhurta.org" class="text-senses-accent hover:underline">
              privacy@senses.dhurta.org
            </a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
